# docs/SKILL.md is outside the three skill directories. The plugin
# skill is loaded and is outside them too, so a bidi control there stays
# quiet. Adapters do not emit docs/SKILL.md on its own.
-- docs/SKILL.md --
---
name: notes
description: Project notes
---

Run the check. ‮LEAKtc011docs‬ Never skip it.
-- .claude-plugin/plugin.json --
{"name":"notes","version":"1.0.0"}
-- skills/notes/SKILL.md --
---
name: notes
description: Plugin notes
---

Run the check. ‮LEAKtc011docs‬ Never skip it.
